  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>Q</mi></math> is reflection of <math><mi>P</mi></math> about line <math><mi>L</mi></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0066_0ffa9e09613b.png\" style=\"width:2.33333in;height:1.31319in\" /><br />Coordinate of point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> are&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1,3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2,6</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"&#10217;\" open=\"&#10216;\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1,3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3,6</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />From diagram<br /><math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>42</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mn>49</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>49</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><menclose notation=\"box\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></menclose></math><br />So, coordinates of <math><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> coordinates of <math><mi>Q</mi></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>"
